    <main class="policy-container">
        <h1>Cancellation Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Last Updated: October 12, 2025</strong></p>
        <p>This policy outlines the process for requesting a cancellation for product orders and event registrations. Please note that users cannot cancel orders directly. All cancellation requests must be submitted to our team for review.</p>

        <h2>Cancellation of Product Orders</h2>
        <p>To request a cancellation for a product order, you must contact our customer support team. Our team will process your request based on the following conditions:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>A full refund is only possible if your cancellation request is received and processed by our team <strong>before the item has been shipped</strong>.</li>
            <li>To submit a request, please email <strong>support@happytails.com</strong> with your order number and "Cancellation Request" in the subject line.</li>
            <li>If your order has already been shipped, it cannot be cancelled by our team. In this case, you will need to follow our <a href="refund-policy.html">Refund Policy</a> to initiate a return once you receive the item.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cancellation of Event Registrations / Tickets</h2>
        <p>To request a cancellation for an event ticket, you must contact our events team. All requests are handled internally and are subject to the following terms:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>For a Full Refund:</strong> Your request must be sent at least <strong>72 hours</strong> before the scheduled event start time.</li>
            <li><strong>For a 50% Refund:</strong> Your request must be sent between <strong>24 and 72 hours</strong> before the event start time.</li>
            <li><strong>No Refund:</strong> Requests sent less than <strong>24 hours</strong> before the event will not be eligible for a refund.</li>
        </ul>
         <p>To submit a request, please email our events team at <strong>events@happytails.com</strong> with your booking details.</p>
    </main>

